{"id":"MyZIP3IoUnHPC6dJ","meta":{"instanceId":"bc8ca75c203589705ae2e446cad7181d6f2a7cc1766f958ef9f34810e53b8cb2"},"name":"Scrape Amazon invoice links into Google Sheets","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"5420a0e8-2497-4269-8de8-4c9e47e4dd4d","name":"Sticky Note - Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[224,-304],"parameters":{"width":812,"height":1240,"content":"# Scrape Amazon invoice links into Google Sheets\n\nEvery night this workflow signs into your Amazon order history in a cloud browser, reads the orders on the page, and writes each order ID with its invoice link into a Google Sheet. Useful for bookkeeping, where someone otherwise opens every order by hand to download the invoice.\n\n### How it works\n1. A schedule trigger starts the run at 2am.\n2. Airtop opens a cloud browser session using a saved profile, so your Amazon login is remembered between runs.\n3. The order history page is opened and given 15 seconds to load, then the visible page text is scraped.\n4. An AI agent reads that text and returns each order ID with its invoice link as structured JSON. A second model auto-fixes the output if the format is off.\n5. If a link was found, a Code node strips Amazon's tracking parameters, and each order ID and clean link is appended to your sheet.\n6. The browser session is closed so you are not billed for idle time.\n\n### Setup\n1. Add your Airtop API key to the three Airtop nodes and your OpenAI API key to both model nodes.\n2. Connect your Google Sheets account, then pick your own spreadsheet on the Add links to the sheet node. It needs the columns Order ID, Invoice URL and Date.\n3. In Airtop, create a browser profile, log into Amazon once inside it, and put that profile name in the Start browser session node.\n4. Run once manually to confirm the login still works, then activate.\n\n### Customization\nChange the trigger hour, or raise the wait if your order history is slow to render."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"6d1d0af2-bacd-42bd-8288-573b269578ca","name":"Sticky Note - Section 1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1168,0],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1140,"height":340,"content":"## 1. Open your Amazon orders\nA cloud browser opens your order history using a saved Airtop profile, so the login is remembered. It waits 15 seconds for the page to finish loading."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"d4ceeb53-30ef-4558-be25-3fc38498cdcb","name":"Sticky Note - Section 2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2336,0],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1148,"height":820,"content":"## 2. Read the invoice links\nThe page text is scraped and an AI agent pulls out each order ID with its invoice link as structured JSON. Rows without a link are dropped."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2176044c-69a8-4271-895c-00d3f52d2807","name":"Sticky Note - Section 3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3520,0],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":838,"height":340,"content":"## 3. Save and clean up\nTracking parameters are stripped from each link, the rows are appended to your sheet, and the browser session is closed."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"25d89d50-bee3-4fdb-be71-f4e7481841e7","name":"Find order IDs and invoice links","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","position":[2688,160],"parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.data.modelResponse.scrapedContent.text }}","options":{},"promptType":"define","hasOutputParser":true},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"3aceb723-1d2f-4769-be74-82dd93de3446","name":"Chat model - Extraction","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","position":[2592,400],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4.1-mini"},"options":{}},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"A14MqVJzO7cufz8t","name":"Open AI - Misc for testing"}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"8ac3aeba-3942-4f0c-bc8a-0961ae3633b5","name":"Auto-fixing Output Parser","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserAutofixing","position":[2800,400],"parameters":{"options":{}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"445f5e16-049d-4fcc-911d-c8fc08c9012c","name":"Output Parser - Order and link","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured","position":[2752,640],"parameters":{"jsonSchemaExample":"[\n  {\"Order Id\": \"Order_Id\",\n  \"Invoice URL\":\"Invoice_URL\"}\n]\n"},"typeVersion":1.3},{"id":"943ac31a-10dd-4098-8898-2766c466dff4","name":"Chat model - Parser auto-fix","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","position":[2960,640],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4.1-mini"},"options":{}},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"A14MqVJzO7cufz8t","name":"Open AI - Misc for testing"}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"66218747-6192-4b5a-828d-820f01111bf4","name":"Start browser session","type":"n8n-nodes-base.airtop","position":[1504,160],"parameters":{"profileName":"YOUR_AIRTOP_PROFILE_NAME","timeoutMinutes":8,"additionalFields":{},"saveProfileOnTermination":true},"credentials":{"airtopApi":{"id":"LPwBJkno0nJWMMKl","name":"Content Posting Via Abun Tool | Dharmendra"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a2c0565e-6067-4fb6-9495-e0e0811895cd","name":"Open Amazon order history","type":"n8n-nodes-base.airtop","position":[1792,160],"parameters":{"url":"=https://www.amazon.com/gp/your-account/order-history","resource":"window","getLiveView":true,"additionalFields":{}},"credentials":{"airtopApi":{"id":"LPwBJkno0nJWMMKl","name":"Content Posting Via Abun Tool | Dharmendra"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"9ad8d88c-9256-44e4-8282-052321634cc6","name":"Add links to the sheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[3840,160],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"Date":"={{ $now.toFormat(\"dd LLL yyyy\") }}","Order ID":"={{ $json.order_id }}","Invoice URL ":"={{ $json.invoice_url }}"},"schema":[{"id":"Order ID","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Order ID","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"Invoice URL ","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Invoice URL ","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"Date","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Date","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":[],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Amazon Invoices"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID","cachedResultName":"Your invoice spreadsheet"}},"typeVersion":4.6},{"id":"1bf2a1cd-589b-42b0-ad22-811773de5ece","name":"Close browser session","type":"n8n-nodes-base.airtop","position":[4128,160],"parameters":{"operation":"terminate","sessionId":"={{ $('Scrape the order page').item.json.sessionId }}"},"credentials":{"airtopApi":{"id":"LPwBJkno0nJWMMKl","name":"Content Posting Via Abun Tool | Dharmendra"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"02cb13ea-880f-4935-8a39-76911125dc23","name":"Wait for page to load","type":"n8n-nodes-base.wait","position":[2064,160],"webhookId":"f1e797ed-7e7b-4ed9-9087-0a4cc62a1e61","parameters":{"amount":15},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"57e089d2-ee54-426d-bc8b-796d67567e42","name":"Run every night","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[1232,160],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"triggerAtHour":2}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"e798dc2e-9597-4003-a496-fe840e91b8c7","name":"Found an invoice link?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[3200,160],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"3b07946b-c4fa-4ca4-8d25-3ce64a3a6357","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{$json[\"output\"][0][\"Invoice URL\"]}}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"2dbb833e-0110-4db1-80ef-7ea6866ae541","name":"Clean up the invoice links","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3568,160],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Turn the AI output into one item per invoice, with a clean URL.\nconst rows = items[0].json.output || [];\n\nreturn rows.map(obj => {\n  // Amazon appends tracking parameters after '&' - keep only the base invoice URL\n  const cleanUrl = String(obj[\"Invoice URL\"] || '').split(\"&\")[0];\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      order_id: obj[\"Order Id\"],\n      invoice_url: cleanUrl\n    }\n  };\n});\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"3470c65d-bd5c-45c9-ab54-b66eaa5b27df","name":"Scrape the order page","type":"n8n-nodes-base.airtop","position":[2400,160],"parameters":{"resource":"extraction","operation":"scrape"},"credentials":{"airtopApi":{"id":"LPwBJkno0nJWMMKl","name":"Content Posting Via Abun Tool | Dharmendra"}},"typeVersion":1}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"331ed9b1-9c0d-4f42-bd75-766c35b6274d","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"Run every night":{"main":[[{"node":"Start browser session","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Scrape the order page":{"main":[[{"node":"Find order IDs and invoice links","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Start browser session":{"main":[[{"node":"Open Amazon order history","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Wait for page to load":{"main":[[{"node":"Scrape the order page","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Add links to the sheet":{"main":[[{"node":"Close browser session","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Found an invoice link?":{"main":[[{"node":"Clean up the invoice links","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Chat model - Extraction":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Find order IDs and invoice links","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Auto-fixing Output Parser":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"Find order IDs and invoice links","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]},"Open Amazon order history":{"main":[[{"node":"Wait for page to load","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Clean up the invoice links":{"main":[[{"node":"Add links to the sheet","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Chat model - Parser auto-fix":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Auto-fixing Output Parser","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Output Parser - Order and link":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"Auto-fixing Output Parser","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]},"Find order IDs and invoice links":{"main":[[{"node":"Found an invoice link?","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}